{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "df1be6f14d705c34f8226433924c48957f304df68cb75f0d53b3d3bc6b5cf72a", "ja": "霧の中、手を引いて", "zh": "迷雾之中，牵着双手", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "572afc6dd1f1850684e4b728f92b854fb7aca4b307b539288e962e2c7440f2d0", "ja": "新曲のテーマであるコンテンポラリーダンス\nを理解するため、まずはビデオを鑑賞してみ\nるも、まだ掴めない星梨花、あずさ、海美。\n唯一理解のあるロコのレクチャーや、実際の\nダンスを経て、少しずつ理解を深めていく。", "zh": "为了理解新曲的主题——现代舞，\n星梨花、梓和海美先试着观看视频，\n却还是没能掌握其中的要领。\n经过唯一理解现代舞的ROCO的讲解，以及实际的\n舞蹈练习，她们逐渐加深了理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "520b719fddb32de8005cb49f4fc4a62074d7390e275107cf4ab97403bfb355a1", "ja": "（全員が全員コンテンポラリーダンスを知っている\nわけではない。まず、そこのすり合わせからだな！）", "zh": "（并不是所有人都了解现代舞。首先得从这方面开始协调才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3921b718e4c58d1208653690a9bd63de7add02dafbaacb77b08fe2a993a6de29", "ja": "（というわけで……コンテンポラリーダンスの\n作品集を借りて、みんなで鑑賞会をしているが……）", "zh": "（所以说……借来了当代舞作品集，正和大家一起进行观赏会，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "b85d0cee9ec2f1dc80757c6a9c71d70510231c9d6ec5c26b2b96c5be30e42c16", "ja": "これが、コンテンポラリーダンス……。\nええと……。", "zh": "这就是……现代舞。\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "7bf05a7652196d9ae8f893518420c94f8aca54cacbd1d8b871b08b053777a542", "ja": "感想を言うのも難しいわよね。激しかったり、\n穏やかだったり……とっても独特だったもの。", "zh": "要说感想也很难呢。有时很激烈，\n有时又很平和……真的非常独特。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "10ad4a979fef7d98ec536312f58883a01ce5f525ec7477d2323ad7987877ae96", "ja": "はい。今までいろんなダンスを踊って\nきましたけど、そのどれとも違いました。", "zh": "是的。虽然至今为止跳过各种各样的舞蹈，但和那些都不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "387b20e2c82f63ccad89b62e8db1b3030c6568d4ba0dd40482de1d50310cb34c", "ja": "海美ちゃんは、バレエ教室で触れたことがあるのよね。\nその時は、どうだった？", "zh": "海美以前在芭蕾舞教室接触过吧。\n那时候感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "2eb2286418d66d9243f1669259e71ba3e35b9da16b5fd7e71ecd29b7bb18a5d6", "ja": "うーん……バレエ教室に通ってる時に、\n踊ってる子はいたけど……。", "zh": "嗯……我去上芭蕾课的时候，确实见过有人跳这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "f29fc989cbd02d82f81180108d7ea06d566fdffc0983ac3e5b2a06d2943d950d", "ja": "クラシックバレエとは全然違うから……\nその時もわからなかったし、今もわからないな～。", "zh": "因为和古典芭蕾完全不一样……\n那时候我也没弄明白，现在还是不明白呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "31a291d623ca18aefb31c03060af0ea96a4600f093546ec8c0fd6c5f056a936a", "ja": "そうだな……一概に言えるものではないし、\n時間がかかるとは思ってたから、ゆっくり……。", "zh": "是啊……这也不能一概而论，我本来就觉得需要花时间，所以慢慢来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "d2a1d3d1e34dbd07e3487dde19fd7a2561436a9580590ad83953e3fc0ce64d45", "ja": "ふっふっふっ……。", "zh": "呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "c9a442d53e81a24806bad1f8d35bde33d27158a75d227f33e42b5a76c73126ed", "ja": "{$P$}！\n今回のテーマは、ロコマターだと思いませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}！\n你不觉得这次的主题，应该归ROCO管吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e5fbada837bcf6ead071fe995ca46301e8510d933cc6fb1c5fbab45200d86e61", "ja": "おお、ロコ。確かにロコは、この中で唯一、\nコンテンポラリーダンスを知っているみたいだったな。", "zh": "哦，ROCO。确实，ROCO好像是这里面唯一懂现代舞的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "1a2850edd553b6bb5438679b8fca5d26f499652e526f7786b5f6912c77665d12", "ja": "はい！　ロコはアイドルであり、アーティスト……\nアートなダンス、もちろんチェックしてますよ！", "zh": "没错！ROCO既是偶像，也是艺术家……\n艺术感十足的舞蹈，我当然关注过啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "95da07bfc01d950a90e1f655bb2dd4c9c57286df51de5f86e85e2cd4a34cdd13", "ja": "そうか……それなら、ロコに\nレクチャーしてもらうのもアリかな？", "zh": "这样啊……那让ROCO来教我，或许也不错？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "03cee5034bb18ad206fc927d233c418d8281e316719f5a89204771406f0e6cdc", "ja": "仲間から教えてもらえるならそれが一番だよね！\n教えて、ロコロコ！", "zh": "如果能让伙伴教我，那当然是最好的啦！\n教教我吧，ROCOROCO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "9597f42110dccf716dc5760144d824d81f5035928324b0eae0bd4eedf1d18291", "ja": "まかせてください！　ロコのレクチャーがあれば、\nみんなもすぐに理解できちゃいますよ♪", "zh": "包在我身上！只要有ROCO的授课，\n大家肯定也能马上理解的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "6afeedd9ddee0ac686af53f1bcdc00abf82052c14d34126c677a2667a0cb331c", "ja": "コンテンポラリーダンスはアートとダンスのシナジー。\nでも、決してディフィカルトなものじゃありません。", "zh": "现代舞是艺术与舞蹈的协同效应。\n不过，绝不是什么困难的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "29fec5bba284b500bc0f684f289df81faff2a63b90aabf712ed072fe60d32c95", "ja": "イージーに言えば、エモーションをインクルージョン\nさせて、ダンスにサブリメーションしたものなの。", "zh": "简单来说，就是把情感融入其中，再升华成舞蹈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "95d86fd95cfdbdc4d33c34fb8f155c7cb22845e144b561eec6dab33625c51943", "ja": "いんく……え？　さぶ……？", "zh": "因克……诶？　萨布……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "c0033a0938253227dfb375d9b498ce142dd8d5128531801a7322f678de4c47de", "ja": "でも、そのエクスプレッションは決してクローズドな\nものではなく、むしろオープンなものなんです。", "zh": "不过，那种表现绝不是封闭的，\n反而是开放的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "f1a77b935f22cb6c0e25fbc3eec2a5f5ac44d37426580136ff04b3ceab391c89", "ja": "ダンサーとスペースでビルドしていくインスタレー\nションアートでもあると、ロコは考えています！", "zh": "ROCO认为，这也是一种通过舞者和空间共同构筑起来的装置艺术！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "6c62f1363f03e313e8b2514f7444a44f4fafac03fb40e1f046ea5dac450abd7c", "ja": "？？？\nえ……っと……？", "zh": "？？？　呃……这个……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "dbfaf93f9e08184aed1d4af61bc495d53860b3d9516da4d2ca9d2675b2356fff", "ja": "すまんロコ。予感はしてたけど、\nみんなフリーズしちゃいそうだから……。", "zh": "抱歉，ROCO。虽然我早有预感，但大家好像都要当机了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "0136b6b4e267d4701cc1fbaf33a54217f0aec81e211e6bdc0a8be5ec378e47af", "ja": "あっ、ソーリーです。\nワードだけではディフィカルトでしたか……。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。\n光靠语言来说太难懂了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "70b75c1b9113cc5dcda622c2a74231413852aded7ed176c3344ae7392328932a", "ja": "面白いレクチャーだったよ。でも言葉だけだと、\n実感できなくて難しいのは確かだな。", "zh": "是很有趣的讲解。不过光靠语言确实很难切身体会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "494fc5f020e1c0696bf3b0ef901c90eaab120d817be08223b6296306d279b4cc", "ja": "座学だけじゃダメなら……\nやっぱり、ダンスレッスンかしら？", "zh": "光靠理论课不行的话……\n果然还是得去上舞蹈课吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "5523570912e7f4dbf2fe1aeccb3ac46b3bd2346b99bef79266247c51577d10f3", "ja": "待ってました！　ロコロコのレクチャーも面白いけど、\n私はこっちの方が手っ取り早いかも！", "zh": "就等这句话呢！虽然ROCOROCO讲课也挺有意思，\n但对我来说可能还是这种方式来得更快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "c05a921848624a6e60b20b42d9a94708e223b171057f7e4e00a91dc030a1d1e1", "ja": "そうですね……。実際に体を動かしてみたら、\nわたしにもわかるかも？", "zh": "是啊……实际动起来试试，说不定我也能明白？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "49a8b75d8a41de52aeffe48028a9344f18fac3c94ddb48b5f24e2651d47cfe83", "ja": "よし、それじゃ早速\nレッスンルームに移動してみよう。", "zh": "好，那我们这就\n去练习室试试看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "3436f9ec5b31cc762be527939dc237408e96525fa40a090a7a284ddd191fddd5", "ja": "参考動画に合わせて、踊ってみましたけど……\n{$P$}さん、うまくできてますか？", "zh": "我试着跟着参考视频跳了一下……\n{$P$}先生，我跳得还可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "34fbbcd9acb721dac7a31c55c5878b598d8b519ea622cef9f2a022cac970d5ec", "ja": "うーん、動き自体はレッスンで慣れると思うけど。\n上手いかどうかと聞かれると、難しいな……。", "zh": "嗯，动作本身应该能通过练习熟悉起来。\n要问跳得好不好，那就很难说了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1031_010azu", "source_sha256": "5e8b26c409add874fc999d6a416da81269ae56d3d8d696079b2866082ac0797d", "ja": "{$P$}さんから見ても、\n上手に踊れているかどうかの判断は難しいですか？", "zh": "从{$P$}先生的角度来看，\n也很难判断跳得好不好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "44ee0cf485c839735d66c5e19f5282f3968f12999cd505be2c0eba1ece874539", "ja": "何を表現しているかが、大事なダンスだと思うんです。\nなので表現が乗ってこないと、まだなんとも……。", "zh": "我觉得，舞蹈最重要的是能表达出什么。\n所以如果还没能融入情感的话，就还不好说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1033_025roc", "source_sha256": "a42c756c425b9cb8f284839c91934f9fad2e6a6a0768ecd897fc670474d5c1f6", "ja": "うう……ちょっとハードワークでしたね……。\nロコはクールダウンを長めに……。", "zh": "呜呜……稍微有点运动过度了呢……\nROCO要多放松一会儿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1034_029umi", "source_sha256": "2c7ba761148a3618690fde3dbde99163f153e95c86e61c2aa97c052cf88fb503", "ja": "確かにしっくりこないなぁ。でも、もう少しで\nなにか……ロコロコ、手伝ってくれない？", "zh": "确实感觉哪里不对劲呢。不过，再差一点点就……ROCOROCO，能帮我一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1035_025roc", "source_sha256": "b10f655df9b5d9c277a42997684b683739a85e497a55d6a3bcfdef3fd72dac39", "ja": "ええっ！？　ろ、ロコですか！？", "zh": "诶诶！？　是、是ROCO吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1036_029umi", "source_sha256": "0a3bc02e7f20aa00323c6244c55849e222566239953e83058cbdf5f27630d3a1", "ja": "うん！　なんとなくだけど、ロコロコの\nダンスが一番いい気がするんだよね。", "zh": "嗯！虽然只是感觉，但总觉得ROCOROCO的舞蹈最好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "3201230413df86367357de3e648e9863b350b857bd4691f58d38d72f7c2f4a72", "ja": "確かに、表現力はロコが一番だったかもしれない。\nやっぱり、アーティストだからなのかな。", "zh": "确实，表现力可能要数ROCO最出色了。\n果然是因为她是艺术家的缘故吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1038_025roc", "source_sha256": "7b43ee3bd4ff3a6dc1a58f9cfe0969e0bd1d92774b2897306443b4d04b102fb4", "ja": "え、えへへ……♪　そういうことなら、\nちょっとだけオーバーワークしても……♪", "zh": "诶、诶嘿嘿……♪　既然是这样，那就稍微加加班……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1039_029umi", "source_sha256": "9f163ac496ee3adf36ca0f006643c1583b85c5a997885a4e43fe02e8aa811356", "ja": "ありがとね、ロコロコ！\nよしっ。まずは振り付けを、体に覚えさせるぞーっ！", "zh": "谢谢你，ROCOROCO！\n好嘞。首先要把舞蹈动作，让身体彻底记住——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1040_010azu", "source_sha256": "d091a42fd9c64af7c8930e271f0fe21eed797dc068cedaa274447003106f2597", "ja": "私たちも、負けていられないわね。\n星梨花ちゃん、もう少し頑張ってみましょ！", "zh": "我们也不能落后呢。\n星梨花，再加把劲吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1041_022ser", "source_sha256": "67a0e9fb931ecf2691a9d6f71acd26c5956f69e0a1fb5ff9fcd7ddd9dfbb8265", "ja": "はい！　わたしも、\nあずささんと一緒にがんばります♪", "zh": "好的！我也会和梓小姐一起加油♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "8083dc9844a2975dbe92791bc2f4dc06110aa11c81e01c8fe72b3972bbc3232c", "ja": "（芸術の道は険しく厳しいはず……。\nまずは頭も手も動かしながら探っていこう！）", "zh": "（艺术之路想必险阻而艰难……先一边动脑一边动手，摸索着前进吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
